{
    "comment": "회원 상세 화면에 마일리지 탭을 하나 더 얹는 조각. 주입이 **두 군데**로 갈리는 것이 이 파일의\n  요점이다 — 탭 버튼은 `inject_props` 로 기존 탭 목록 배열에 항목을 덧붙이고(`append`), 그 탭이\n  펼칠 본문은 별도 앵커(`extension_tab_content`)에 자식으로 붙인다. 둘을 잇는 것은 `id`\n  (`ext_mileage`) 하나뿐이라 한쪽만 고치면 탭은 있고 내용은 빈 화면이 된다.\n  마일리지 기능을 끈 상태(`enabled=false`)에도 탭은 남고 안내문만 대신 나온다 — 잔액이 이미\n  쌓인 회원이 있을 수 있어 숫자를 감추지 않는다.\n  이 화면에서 금액을 고칠 수는 없다. 조정은 마일리지 내역 화면 몫이고 여기서는 그 화면으로\n  회원 이메일을 검색조건에 실어 보내기만 한다.",
    "target_layout": "admin_user_detail",
    "priority": 320,
    "injections": [
        {
            "target_id": "user_detail_tabs",
            "position": "inject_props",
            "props": {
                "tabs": {
                    "_append": [
                        {
                            "id": "ext_mileage",
                            "label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.tab_label",
                            "iconName": "coins",
                            "if": "{{!!user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "target_id": "extension_tab_content",
            "position": "append_child",
            "components": [
                {
                    "id": "ext_mileage_content",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage}}",
                    "props": {
                        "id": "ext_mileage",
                        "className": "ecommerce:scroll-mt-32"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "id": "section_mileage_summary",
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "ecommerce-admin-card"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:justify-between ecommerce:mb-4"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Icon",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "name": "coins",
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-xl ecommerce:text-gray-600 ecommerce:dark:text-gray-400"
                                                    }
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "H3",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-white"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.title"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "composite",
                                            "name": "ExtensionBadge",
                                            "props": {
                                                "type": "module",
                                                "identifier": "sirsoft-ecommerce",
                                                "installedModules": "{{_global.installedModules}}"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "comment": "비활성화 안내 (mileage.enabled=false)",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "if": "{{!user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.enabled}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:flex ecommerce:items-center ecommerce:gap-2 ecommerce:p-4 ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-900 ecommerce:rounded-lg ecommerce:text-sm ecommerce-text-muted"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "circle-info",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-base ecommerce:flex-shrink-0"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.disabled_notice"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Div",
                                    "if": "{{user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.enabled}}",
                                    "responsive": {
                                        "desktop": {
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:grid ecommerce:grid-cols-4 ecommerce:gap-4 ecommerce:mb-4"
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "ecommerce:grid ecommerce:grid-cols-2 ecommerce:gap-4 ecommerce:mb-4"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:p-3 ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-900 ecommerce:rounded-lg"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce-text-muted ecommerce:mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.available"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-white"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.available ?? 0).toLocaleString()}} P"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:p-3 ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-900 ecommerce:rounded-lg"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce-text-muted ecommerce:mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.pending"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce-text-muted"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.pending ?? 0).toLocaleString()}} P"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:p-3 ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-900 ecommerce:rounded-lg"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce-text-muted ecommerce:mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.total_earned"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce:text-gray-900 ecommerce:dark:text-white"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.total_earned ?? 0).toLocaleString()}} P"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Div",
                                            "props": {
                                                "className": "ecommerce:p-3 ecommerce:bg-gray-50 ecommerce:dark:bg-gray-900 ecommerce:rounded-lg"
                                            },
                                            "children": [
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-xs ecommerce-text-muted ecommerce:mb-1"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.expiring_soon"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "type": "basic",
                                                    "name": "Span",
                                                    "props": {
                                                        "className": "ecommerce:block ecommerce:text-lg ecommerce:font-semibold ecommerce:text-amber-700 ecommerce:dark:text-amber-400"
                                                    },
                                                    "text": "{{(user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.expiring_soon ?? 0).toLocaleString()}} P"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "view_member_mileage_history",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "A",
                                    "if": "{{user?.data?.ecommerce_mileage?.enabled}}",
                                    "props": {
                                        "href": "{{'/admin/ecommerce/mileage-transactions?search_field=email&search_keyword=' + encodeURIComponent(user?.data?.email ?? '')}}",
                                        "target": "_blank",
                                        "className": "ecommerce-btn ecommerce-btn-secondary ecommerce:gap-1.5 ecommerce:px-3"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Icon",
                                            "props": {
                                                "name": "list",
                                                "className": "ecommerce:text-base"
                                            }
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "type": "basic",
                                            "name": "Span",
                                            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.user_mileage.view_history"
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
